abstract: >-
  A domain-agnostic, 60 Hz closed-loop functionalist whole-brain cognitive engine (v2.3.0)
  paired with InkBlitz 3D, a two-stage 180-degree symmetric 3D paint-territory and core-escort
  research simulator (Stage 1: Classic Citadel and Stage 2: Occluded Twin-Flank). Integrates a
  7-process lock-free SeqLock+CRC32 architecture (strict single-GPU Barrier 1 + Zero-PyTorch
  C++ /O2 spatial kernels), 4-layer allocentric hippocampal spatial memory with stationary-landmark
  Kalman localization, cerebellar 3D ballistic lead-aim, basal ganglia STN-SNr timing inhibition
  with 0 ms emergency escape bypass, a 3-head categorical RSSM world model with Dreamer-style
  encoder ownership and counterfactual de-confounding, metastable GNWT broadcasting with
  straight-through zero-gated top-down feedback, Oizumi-2016 lagged causal integrated information
  (Phi_G), Plan-A motor-isolated inner speech, progressive Scaffold Annealing (autonomous neural
  mode), and 4-phase sleep consolidation (S-1 to S-4).
